{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://opentine.com/schemas/tine-cli-label-1.schema.json",
  "title": "tine label VERB --json",
  "description": "Rubric label queues (0.89). `init` starts a queue with a rubric pinned by digest; `assign` and `reassign` record who labels which item (reassignment names `from` and a reason); `next` lists a reviewer's unlabelled items without any judge output; `submit` signs one label bound to the reviewer key, rubric digest and item digest; `reveal` files a judge's outputs (labels recorded after it do not count toward that judge). `agree` reports human agreement (Krippendorff's alpha, Fleiss' and Cohen's kappa) and each revealed judge's Cohen's kappa against the human consensus, with bootstrap intervals; undefined values are null and never pass a floor.",
